# =============================================================================
# .NET / WPF port (see PORT-PLAN.md).  Appended - nothing above this line was
# changed or reordered; the Delphi build still depends on it.
#
# Already covered above and deliberately not repeated:
#   [Bb]in/, [Oo]bj/, [Ll]og/, [Ll]ogs/   build output and the LOGS\ run directory
#   *.exe                                  build output
#   *.ini                                  settings files must never be committed
#   *.local, *.binlog, .vscode/*           already listed
# =============================================================================

# DO NOT REMOVE.  The Mac bundle pattern "*.app" further up matches the QuickStat.App project
# directory (git is case-insensitive on Windows), which silently hides the entire WPF application
# from source control.  The existing line is left in place as required, so re-include the project
# here instead.
!/QuickStat.App/

